      "studiedAt": "2026-09-01T19:36:20.487Z",
      "studiedNote": "1086 Steris Cable taught that standard AOIs/UDTs in a project do not make it standard-shaped: it added new anti-pattern evidence on motion-in-state-logic with hollow/orphan states, hand-mirrored colliding alarm indices, cross-program handshaking via controller-scope bits, AlwaysOff/AFI gates that disable comm monitoring and safety bypass words, duplicated HMI/production data with dead OEE fields, plus legacy device evidence for the IPG YLR laser, ifm IO-Link master and reel VFD.",
      "sizeBytes": 1942032,
      "hash": "29ae7bb02b2e",
      "priority": 110
