      "status": "studied",
      "studiedAt": "2026-09-17T11:23:02.119Z",
      "studiedNote": "TopAlarms taught that the downtime scoreboard is fed only by the blamed first-cause fault record and is keyed on message text in a plain 82-char STRING, making severity selection and message composition part of the data layer.",
      "sizeBytes": 70104,
      "hash": "53f145055d4c",
      "priority": 75
    },
    {
